	(text "AIN0-AIN1 = REF-SENSE. Start at +/-2.048 V.\nAIN2 = excitation / 2; AIN3 = O2 mid-supply bias.\nValidate zero/span with known O2/He mixes and\ncontrolled temperature, humidity, pressure and flow."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 352.425 218.44 0)
